===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|decade}}, from {{der|en|fro|decade}}, from {{der|en|LL.|decās|decādem|t=(set of) ten}}, from {{der|en|grc|δεκάς}}, from {{m|grc|δέκα||ten}}. In reference to a span of ten years, originally a clipping of the phrase ''decade of'' {{m|en|years}}. {{surf|en|deca-|-ad|alt2=-ade}}. {{dbt|en|decad}}.

